---
skip_list:
  # Vars are prefixed by domain, not by role name: rsnapshot uses
  # rsnapshot_*, dsm_config_audit uses dsm_audit_*, docker_log_rotation uses
  # docker_daemon_*. Waived deliberately, not an oversight.
  #
  # borgmatic_citadel/borgmatic_warrig were the original reason for this
  # waiver; they merged into roles/borgmatic and are now compliant. The
  # waiver still has to stay for the three roles above.
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
